 12, the record for Hardeman County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, and in 2025 it came in at 19% of normal. March to April ran 286% of normal in 2025 on the middle. Grid 16921 had its driest year in 2011 at 40% of normal.</p>"}
